<opsproc code="00008935.0002001" revdate="2021-05-19T09:49:13"><title><abb>IR</abb> 3 (for aircraft with Honeywell 10 MCU <abb>ADIRU</abb> with <abb>IR</abb> 3 totally inoperative)</title><procitem layer="1" lid="N.00008935.0002001.017"><title>General information</title><procbody lid="N.00008935.0002001.018"><inform layer="1" lid="N.00008935.0002001.019"><para code="00008935.0001001.006" layer="1" lid="N.00008935.0001001.017">For aircraft
fitted with Honeywell 10 MCU <abb>ADIRU</abb>, disregard the characteristic
speeds (Vls, F, S, Green Dot) displayed on the <abb>PFD</abb>. For
characteristic speeds (Vls, F, S, Green Dot) determination, <duref product="QRH" ref="00010999"/>. The “CHECK GW” (or “CHECK WEIGHT”)
message may be displayed on the <abb>MCDU</abb>.</para></inform></procbody></procitem><procitem layer="1" lid="N.00008935.0002001.009"><title>Flight preparation/limitations</title><procbody lid="N.00008935.0002001.010"><limit layer="1" lid="N.00008935.0002001.027"><lit-limit lid="N.00008935.0002001.028">For aircraft with the <abb>RNP</abb> <abb>AR</abb> capability, <abb>RNP</abb> <abb>AR</abb> operations are not permitted.</lit-limit></limit><limit layer="1" lid="N.00008935.0002001.011"><lit-limit lid="N.00008935.0002001.012">Maximum landing capability is CAT 3 SINGLE.</lit-limit></limit></procbody></procitem><procitem layer="1" lid="N.00008935.0002001.013"><title>During cockpit preparation</title><procbody lid="N.00008935.0002001.014"><action layer="1" lid="N.00008935.0002001.015" memory="false"><cr-action code="00008935.0002001.004"><challenge><tech-label type="pb-sw">IR 3</tech-label></challenge><response>OFF</response></cr-action><comment code="00008935.0002001.006"><para layer="1" lid="N.00008935.0002001.020">The F/CTL <emph bold="false" italic="false" overline="false" sub="false" sup="false" underline="true">MAINTENANCE</emph> message is displayed on the <tech-label type="s-page">STATUS</tech-label>.</para></comment></action><condition at-any-time="false" code="00008935.0002001.011" direct="false" layer="1" lid="N.00008935.0002001.029" subtitle="false" type="cond"><intro>If the <tech-label type="pb"> IR 3</tech-label> <tech-label type="light">OFF</tech-label> does not
come ON, or the <abb>ADR</abb> 3 is also inoperative:</intro><procbody lid="N.00008935.0002001.030"><action layer="1" lid="N.00008935.0002001.031" memory="false"><command code="00008935.0002001.012"><para layer="1" lid="N.00008935.0002001.032">Set the <tech-label type="sel">IR 3
Mode</tech-label> to OFF. <abb>MMEL</abb> item 34-10-03 is also applied. <duref product="MMEL" ref="00008545"/>.</para></command></action></procbody></condition></procbody></procitem></opsproc>